  "@type": "Dataset",
  "name": "Arctic Current Meter Data Collated under ESDIM Data Rescue",
  "description": "CM: Current Meters were deployed in the Arctic Ocean and Greenland Sea from 1971-1988. Measures of zonal and meridonal velocities, temperature and salinity were recorded. This data was used to determine ice flow and flow regimes in the high Arctic region.\n\nDeposited content: descriptive metadata only; underlying research data are not included.",
